From 35d35dce7dfd7f81332e17a89e44e1f23cef5f49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:00:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure HTTP TLS certificate lifecycle diagnostics

Copy certificate action, public names and filesystem paths into typed fields;
retain Info severity and existing readable generation/load/renew/reload text.
Capture OpenSSL's error before constructing the event. No TLS policy, private
key, certificate contents, reload schedule or failure return changes.

Add a focused actual-node test for generation, a public-name-triggered renewal,
and invalid certificate files, with exact typed fields/text and no PEM content.
The reload and failed-renewal rare branches are not newly forced by that test.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/http-tls-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/http-tls276-conversion.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/httpserver.cpp

Native validation is pending at this source-only checkpoint; preserve the
252-site native seal separately. Shared eCash owner, not Lotus consensus.

